# Prototyping Rules

## Page Creation

When creating a new prototype page:

1. Use `npm run create-page` or manually create under `app/prototype/<slug>/page.tsx`
2. Update `prototype-manifest.json` with the new page entry
3. Choose a template: `app-shell` (header + nav) or `content-only` (header only)
4. Choose a content layout: `single-column` or `tertiary` (main + aside)

## Component Imports

```tsx
import { Button, Card, Stack, TextInput } from '@appdirect/ds-prototype-kit';
```

Never import from `@mantine/core` in prototype pages. Domain widgets come from `@/components/cbp`.

## Page Structure

```tsx
'use client';

import { AppShellLayout, SingleColumnLayout } from '@appdirect/ds-prototype-kit';

export default function PageName() {
  return (
    <AppShellLayout navItems={navItems} title="App Name">
      <SingleColumnLayout>
        {/* Page content */}
      </SingleColumnLayout>
    </AppShellLayout>
  );
}
```

## Template Selection

- **app-shell**: `AppShellLayout` with `navItems`
- **content-only**: `AppShellLayout` with `hideNav`

## Content Layouts

- **SingleColumnLayout**: full-width content in a `Stack`
- **TertiaryColumnLayout**: main + aside (8/4 grid split)

## Navigation

```tsx
const navItems: NavItem[] = [
  { label: 'Customers', icon: 'ri-team-line', href: '/prototype/customers', active: true },
  { label: 'Settings', icon: 'ri-settings-3-line', href: '/prototype/settings' },
];
```

## Breadcrumbs

```tsx
<Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Prototypes', href: '/prototype' }, { label: 'Page Title' }]} />
```

## Styling

Use Mantine system props only (`bg`, `c`, `p`, `m`, `gap`, `radius`, etc.).
